{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"BTop_n"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"BTop_n"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3]},"content":{"Plain":"\n<p>$\\mathsf{BTop}(n)$ 是 $n$ 维流形范畴 $\\mathsf{Mfd}_n$ 中由一个对象 $\\mathbb{R}^n$ 构成的全子范畴, 是</p>\n"}}